<h1 class="h1" style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #2d3134">
	Reset your password
</h1>

<p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0">
	Hi <%= name %>, we got a request to reset the password for your Tourly account. Press the button below to choose a new
	one.
</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px 0">
	<tr>
		<td style="background-color: #ff7b29; border-radius: 8px">
			<a
				href="<%= resetUILink %>"
				style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none"
				>Set a new password</a
			>
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0">
	This link works once and expires in <strong style="color: #2d3134"><%= expiresInMinutes %> minutes</strong>.
</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #676a6c; word-break: break-all">
	Button not working? Copy this link into your browser:<br />
	<a href="<%= resetUILink %>" style="color: #c2410c"><%= resetUILink %></a>
</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: separate">
	<tr>
		<td style="padding: 14px 16px; background-color: #f7f7f7; border-radius: 10px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; color: #676a6c">
			<strong style="color: #2d3134">Didn't ask for this?</strong> Ignore this email &mdash; your password stays the same
			until you use the link.
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
